<title>UK: AVCO sets 125 million stg three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>AVCO sets 125 million stg three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AVCO TRUST PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AVCO FINANCIAL SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    20.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  99.965    FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    99.965</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.075     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
